    "detailed_description": "In <strong><i>Tristan Cole's Pro Driver</i></strong> you're a stunt driver for hire and willing to take on any paying job that gets you closer to buying your next upgrade. Whether it's taxiing passengers around town, completing objectives, or winning races, you need to drive with both speed &amp; style to to impress your customers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/92d8ab6addc0aa32a57ab2d7292341cf.poster.avif?t=1753538986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/92d8ab6addc0aa32a57ab2d7292341cf.webm?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/92d8ab6addc0aa32a57ab2d7292341cf.mp4?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Weave through traffic, hit &amp; destroy props, and jump across rooftops as you navigate your way through the stylized maps of TCPD. Customize your choice of heavily modified caged street cars featuring custom suspension built for high speed stunts. Score big combos by performing dozens of tricks including wheelies, drifts, spins, flips/rolls, grinds, and plenty of insane aerial stunts.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/f0a92259e07608068ff9f24d7cf4f9d5.poster.avif?t=1753538986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/f0a92259e07608068ff9f24d7cf4f9d5.webm?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/f0a92259e07608068ff9f24d7cf4f9d5.mp4?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Challenge other drivers in a variety of multiplayer modes to show off your style &amp; prove that you're the best stunt driver on the street.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/1d6a9917d8869cb9e93db2f51e8ca5dc.poster.avif?t=1753538986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/1d6a9917d8869cb9e93db2f51e8ca5dc.webm?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/1d6a9917d8869cb9e93db2f51e8ca5dc.mp4?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "In <strong><i>Tristan Cole's Pro Driver</i></strong> you're a stunt driver for hire and willing to take on any paying job that gets you closer to buying your next upgrade. Whether it's taxiing passengers around town, completing objectives, or winning races, you need to drive with both speed &amp; style to to impress your customers.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/92d8ab6addc0aa32a57ab2d7292341cf.poster.avif?t=1753538986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/92d8ab6addc0aa32a57ab2d7292341cf.webm?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/92d8ab6addc0aa32a57ab2d7292341cf.mp4?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Weave through traffic, hit &amp; destroy props, and jump across rooftops as you navigate your way through the stylized maps of TCPD. Customize your choice of heavily modified caged street cars featuring custom suspension built for high speed stunts. Score big combos by performing dozens of tricks including wheelies, drifts, spins, flips/rolls, grinds, and plenty of insane aerial stunts.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/f0a92259e07608068ff9f24d7cf4f9d5.poster.avif?t=1753538986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/f0a92259e07608068ff9f24d7cf4f9d5.webm?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/f0a92259e07608068ff9f24d7cf4f9d5.mp4?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Challenge other drivers in a variety of multiplayer modes to show off your style &amp; prove that you're the best stunt driver on the street.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/1d6a9917d8869cb9e93db2f51e8ca5dc.poster.avif?t=1753538986\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/1d6a9917d8869cb9e93db2f51e8ca5dc.webm?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1677250/extras/1d6a9917d8869cb9e93db2f51e8ca5dc.mp4?t=1753538986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
